WEBVTT

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.827
Whoo-hoo! Yeah!

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:39.248
Whoa! Ah!

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:44.753
Shman! The great rad spot
is mega-sweet for party-boarding!

00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:45.879
Indeed.

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:47.464
Any calls while I was out?

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:48.882
Yeah.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:52.219
You got a telesonic transmission
from Kif a couple hours ago.

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:54.763
My Kiffy called?

00:00:56.782 --> 00:00:57.783
Kif?

00:00:57.866 --> 00:00:59.284
Ooh, Amy, you're back!

00:00:59.368 --> 00:01:01.620
Another hour and I would have
thought about hanging up.

00:01:01.703 --> 00:01:03.830
Why didn't you just
leave a message, sweetie?

00:01:03.914 --> 00:01:06.208
Well, um, I've left hundreds of messages

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:07.668
with your answering machine

00:01:07.793 --> 00:01:09.711
but you never seem to get them.

00:01:09.795 --> 00:01:10.796
Bender!

00:01:10.879 --> 00:01:12.881
It's not my fault if you don't check me.

00:01:16.385 --> 00:01:17.803
Messages erased.

00:01:17.886 --> 00:01:20.806
Oh, dearest,
this long distance relationship

00:01:20.889 --> 00:01:22.265
is too much to bear.

00:01:22.349 --> 00:01:25.936
When even an inch separates us,
I quiver with misery.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:29.481
So you can imagine how I feel
when it's a billion light-years.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.237
Kif, don't cry,
or you'll get a tummy ache.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.282
Lieutenant, some things came off me
and clogged the drain

00:01:38.365 --> 00:01:40.117
so if you could... Oh-ho!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.410
What's this?

00:01:43.787 --> 00:01:45.080
Well, well, well.

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:49.459
Do my eyes believe me
or it that my bosomy swan, Leela?

00:01:49.543 --> 00:01:51.586
Say again? You're breaking up.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.298
Oh!

00:01:54.381 --> 00:01:56.383
Good news, everyone!

00:01:56.466 --> 00:02:00.887
You'll be delivering pain medicine
to the Hive Mind of Nigel 7.

00:02:02.764 --> 00:02:05.058
Scruffy's rolling out a large pill.

00:02:05.142 --> 00:02:06.602
You're going to Nigel 7?

00:02:06.685 --> 00:02:08.604
Kif's on patrol near there.

00:02:08.687 --> 00:02:10.230
You could drop me off on the way.

00:02:10.314 --> 00:02:11.773
We could, but we won't!

00:02:11.857 --> 00:02:14.651
It's a spaceship, damn it,
not a prom limousine.

00:02:14.735 --> 00:02:19.448
Ooh! If anyone needs me,
I'll be in the angry dome.

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:30.667
This is a very long trip,

00:02:30.751 --> 00:02:34.004
so we'll all have to go into
hibernative naptosis to save oxygen.

00:02:34.796 --> 00:02:37.674
Aw, I don't even breathe oxygen.

00:03:03.742 --> 00:03:05.410
Here I come, Kif.

00:03:14.836 --> 00:03:17.089
They jumped right out of their pants.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.969
Oh, what now?

00:03:22.052 --> 00:03:23.679
Activate glass window.

00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:30.936
Kif, I'm sensing a very
sensual disturbance in the force.

00:03:31.019 --> 00:03:33.897
Prepare for ship-to-ship intimacy.

00:03:33.981 --> 00:03:35.732
Yes, sir, Captain.

00:03:53.767 --> 00:03:56.770
How about I help you finish that dream
you were having about me?

00:03:56.854 --> 00:03:58.897
Okay. I was just at this part.

00:04:02.109 --> 00:04:05.612
Oh, eh, let's try that
a little lower and a lot softer.

00:04:06.071 --> 00:04:10.284
Imagine you stowing away
and stealing a licensed starship!

00:04:10.367 --> 00:04:12.911
Oh, it's so romantic,
it gives me the shivers!

00:04:14.413 --> 00:04:16.540
I don't care how much trouble I get in.

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:20.127
I needed to feel my lips
pressed against your lipless beak.

00:04:21.795 --> 00:04:25.632
Oh, Amy, I can't stand having
a whole universe between us.

00:04:25.716 --> 00:04:30.721
I've been thinking a lot about this
and, well, would you move in with me?

00:04:30.804 --> 00:04:33.265
Here? But, uh...

00:04:33.348 --> 00:04:34.850
Wouldn't it be crowded?

00:04:34.933 --> 00:04:37.811
Well, no, no. It's really twice the size.

00:04:37.895 --> 00:04:40.355
You can use the floor,
and I'll have the ceiling.

00:04:40.439 --> 00:04:41.440
See?

00:04:44.401 --> 00:04:48.071
Kif, you have so much
creativity and niceness,

00:04:48.155 --> 00:04:50.282
but I'm not sure if I...

00:04:50.365 --> 00:04:53.786
Hush. Before you answer, come thither.

00:04:55.679 --> 00:04:57.139
This is the Holo-Shed.

00:04:57.514 --> 00:04:59.808
It can simulate anything you desire

00:04:59.892 --> 00:05:03.186
and nothing can hurt you,
except when it malfunctions

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.771
and the holograms become real.

00:05:04.855 --> 00:05:07.274
Well, that probably
won't happen this time.

00:05:07.357 --> 00:05:11.028
I wanted to show you what life
could be like if we were together.

00:05:11.111 --> 00:05:14.114
Computer, run program "Kif One."

00:05:17.576 --> 00:05:19.453
This is so beautiful!

00:05:20.537 --> 00:05:21.788
Spirit!

00:05:21.872 --> 00:05:23.832
Kif, that's the pony I always wanted

00:05:23.916 --> 00:05:26.418
but my parents said
I had too many ponies already.

00:05:26.501 --> 00:05:29.338
Yes, I programmed it in for you.

00:05:29.421 --> 00:05:31.924
Four million lines of BASIC.

00:05:32.007 --> 00:05:35.469
And... And if this isn't the life
you want, how about this?

00:05:35.552 --> 00:05:37.638
Run program "Kif Two."

00:05:40.182 --> 00:05:41.642
Oh, Kif!

00:05:41.725 --> 00:05:45.979
We could live here at the shore
of the Tranquilibrius Sea in a time-share.

00:05:46.438 --> 00:05:49.024
And I would pluck the moon from the sky

00:05:49.107 --> 00:05:50.817
just to see you smile.

00:05:53.362 --> 00:05:54.821
Almost got it.

00:05:55.447 --> 00:05:57.616
It seems to be sort of stuck.

00:05:59.576 --> 00:06:00.827
I love you!

00:06:01.912 --> 00:06:03.497
Ooh!

00:06:05.874 --> 00:06:08.877
Run program "Kif colon slash slash three."

00:06:12.965 --> 00:06:14.132
This isn't bad.

00:06:14.216 --> 00:06:15.884
My aunt had a place like this.

00:06:15.968 --> 00:06:19.603
Amy, we could live in
a bus station bathroom for all I care.

00:06:19.759 --> 00:06:22.933
As long as we're together,
it'll feel like a castle to me.

00:06:23.559 --> 00:06:27.771
Kif, I'd love to live with you... Someday.

00:06:28.272 --> 00:06:31.400
But before then, there's still lots
I want to do on my own.

00:06:33.777 --> 00:06:34.778
What was that?

00:06:34.861 --> 00:06:38.365
Oh, dear. I fear the Holo-Shed
might be broken again.

00:06:38.448 --> 00:06:41.535
Well, as long as we don't
cross paths with Attila the...

00:06:44.913 --> 00:06:46.540
Look... Spirit!

00:06:48.417 --> 00:06:50.002
And there's Professor Moriarty.

00:06:50.085 --> 00:06:51.420
Jack the Ripper.

00:06:51.503 --> 00:06:53.005
Evil Lincoln.

00:06:55.382 --> 00:06:56.508
Right-o, gents.

00:06:56.592 --> 00:07:00.095
It's another simulation gone mad,
so murder and mayhem.

00:07:00.178 --> 00:07:01.471
Standard procedure.

00:07:06.018 --> 00:07:10.731
Real holographic simulated
evil Lincoln is back!

00:07:19.406 --> 00:07:21.033
The Holo-Shed's on the fritz again.

00:07:21.116 --> 00:07:22.409
The characters turned real!

00:07:22.492 --> 00:07:26.413
Damn! The last time that happened,
I got slapped with three paternity suits.

00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:30.459
- Oh, my God!
- I want Daddy!

00:07:30.542 --> 00:07:32.753
Listen up, history's greatest villains.

00:07:32.836 --> 00:07:36.340
Get back into the Holo-Shed
before I start blasting.

00:07:36.465 --> 00:07:37.591
Stop!

00:07:37.674 --> 00:07:40.093
No shoot fire stick in space canoe!

00:07:40.177 --> 00:07:42.596
Cause explosive decompression!

00:07:42.679 --> 00:07:46.433
Spare me your space-age
techno-babble, Attila the Hun.

00:07:57.736 --> 00:07:58.987
Oh!

00:08:03.283 --> 00:08:04.451
Hey!

00:08:04.534 --> 00:08:06.411
Kif, hold on!

00:08:06.536 --> 00:08:07.913
I totally want to!

00:08:11.708 --> 00:08:13.710
Grab on!

00:08:13.794 --> 00:08:16.296
- Over here!
- Please hold me. Oh, dear.

00:08:16.838 --> 00:08:17.839
Have a good one.

00:08:21.385 --> 00:08:22.636
Ow! Oh...

00:08:24.229 --> 00:08:25.731
Aw, man!

00:08:25.864 --> 00:08:29.326
Whew! After all that,
I could use some relaxation.

00:08:29.409 --> 00:08:31.119
I'll be in the Holo-Shed.

00:08:41.213 --> 00:08:45.425
Well, except for a few broken bones,
some internal hemorrhaging

00:08:45.509 --> 00:08:48.845
and a partially barfed-up heart,
everyone appears fine.

00:08:48.929 --> 00:08:50.222
Whew!

00:08:50.806 --> 00:08:52.599
Oh, and Kif is pregnant.

00:08:55.686 --> 00:08:57.104
Oh, joy!

00:09:03.694 --> 00:09:05.404
Amy, isn't it wonderful?

00:09:05.487 --> 00:09:06.613
I'm pregnant.

00:09:06.697 --> 00:09:08.657
Yes, it's great.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.534
A great miracle.

00:09:10.617 --> 00:09:13.745
And not one of those bogus
everyday miracles like a sunrise.

00:09:13.829 --> 00:09:15.163
Aren't you a male?

00:09:15.247 --> 00:09:16.331
Yeah, what's the deal?

00:09:16.415 --> 00:09:19.126
Just when I thought
I figured out you biological creatures,

00:09:19.209 --> 00:09:20.335
it's something else!

00:09:20.419 --> 00:09:21.795
Let me at him!

00:09:21.878 --> 00:09:23.296
I'm going to take...

00:09:24.923 --> 00:09:29.386
Look, I'm sure we're all a little unclear
on how anyone gets pregnant.

00:09:29.469 --> 00:09:31.096
So, Kif, pray explain,

00:09:31.179 --> 00:09:33.974
and don't spare the dirty words
where appropriate.

00:09:34.057 --> 00:09:36.018
Well, it's quite simple, really.

00:09:36.101 --> 00:09:39.604
When one of my species
experiences deep feelings of love,

00:09:39.688 --> 00:09:42.566
we enter a so-called "receptive state."

00:09:42.649 --> 00:09:45.027
You disgust me. Go on.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.236
At that point,

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.947
our skin becomes a semi-permeable membrane

00:09:49.031 --> 00:09:51.867
which allows the passage
of genetic material.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:55.370
I held Amy's hand, and voilà.

00:09:55.454 --> 00:09:58.915
Well, okay,
but that better be all there is.

00:09:58.999 --> 00:10:01.835
Oh, Amy, you'll be a mother!

00:10:06.631 --> 00:10:11.011
What a wondrous affirmation of our love
and all from the touch of your hand.

00:10:12.637 --> 00:10:13.805
Dude, hold up.

00:10:13.889 --> 00:10:15.682
Remember when Zapp
blew a hole in the ship?

00:10:15.766 --> 00:10:16.808
Indeed.

00:10:16.892 --> 00:10:18.185
Kif touched everybody there.

00:10:18.268 --> 00:10:20.103
Couldn't any one of us be the mother?

00:10:20.187 --> 00:10:21.438
Hey, yeah!

00:10:21.521 --> 00:10:23.065
I mean, what about that, Kif?

00:10:23.148 --> 00:10:26.318
Well, I suppose I might have
gotten pregnant that way,

00:10:26.401 --> 00:10:28.070
or even from a toilet seat,

00:10:28.153 --> 00:10:31.865
though that's impossible
since I have a private washroom.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.868
Ah, my home away from home.

00:10:34.951 --> 00:10:39.414
By the way, Kif, your flush seems to be
set on "stun," not "kill."

00:10:43.001 --> 00:10:46.963
Look, Kif, I probably am the mother
although maybe I'm not.

00:10:47.047 --> 00:10:48.423
Of course, I hope I am,

00:10:48.507 --> 00:10:51.677
but just in case I'm not,
maybe we should have a test.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:52.761
A test!

00:10:52.844 --> 00:10:54.763
I demand a test!

00:10:59.017 --> 00:11:00.560
Even I laughed at me

00:11:00.644 --> 00:11:04.314
when I built this alien
cross-species genetic analyzer,

00:11:04.398 --> 00:11:06.650
but I guess I showed myself.

00:11:06.733 --> 00:11:09.361
Subjects, please enter the chamber.

00:11:14.658 --> 00:11:17.202
Now to take a DNA sample.

00:11:25.836 --> 00:11:27.379
When I pull this switch,

00:11:27.462 --> 00:11:31.174
the maternifuge will spin at 10,000 RPM,

00:11:31.258 --> 00:11:34.177
separating out everyone
who isn't the mother...

00:11:34.886 --> 00:11:36.847
Father... Whatever.

00:11:43.937 --> 00:11:45.439
Faster, faster!

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:58.702
Good! Fry's ejection indicates
that he is not the man-mama.

00:12:02.622 --> 00:12:04.416
Nor is Captain Brannigan.

00:12:04.499 --> 00:12:06.168
Oh, thank you, merciful God.

00:12:08.545 --> 00:12:12.132
Zoidberg? What the hell
were you doing in there?

00:12:12.215 --> 00:12:13.550
That's where I live.

00:12:13.633 --> 00:12:15.218
I have no home.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.812
Amy? But that means...

00:12:33.362 --> 00:12:37.240
Leela must have impregnated me
when she grabbed my ungloved hand.

00:12:37.324 --> 00:12:39.534
That explains the poster
in hygiene class...

00:12:39.618 --> 00:12:41.620
"No glove, no love."

00:12:41.703 --> 00:12:44.247
Wow, this is all so confusing.

00:12:44.331 --> 00:12:46.249
Leela, how could you?

00:12:46.333 --> 00:12:48.835
Our love has had to endure
your constant hatred,

00:12:48.919 --> 00:12:50.170
and now this?

00:12:50.253 --> 00:12:52.631
Stop testing our love!

00:12:52.714 --> 00:12:54.591
Oh, please, Captain.

00:12:54.675 --> 00:12:57.469
I thank Leela for the DNA she gave me,

00:12:57.552 --> 00:12:58.929
but in my species,

00:12:59.012 --> 00:13:02.766
the true parent is the one
who inspired the initial feeling of love.

00:13:02.849 --> 00:13:08.397
We call that person the Smizmar,
and my Smizmar is Amy.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.984
So the toilet seat is like
the uncle or something?

00:13:14.236 --> 00:13:16.530
Sorry I got your boyfriend pregnant.

00:13:16.613 --> 00:13:17.739
That's okay.

00:13:17.823 --> 00:13:19.825
At least Kif's baby shower should be fun.

00:13:19.908 --> 00:13:21.493
I better put it on my calendar.

00:13:23.078 --> 00:13:25.831
Thursday, baby shower. Enter.

00:13:27.165 --> 00:13:29.418
Might as well plan
for my new life while I'm at it.

00:13:29.835 --> 00:13:31.837
Set motherhood mode.

00:13:39.636 --> 00:13:40.846
To motherhood.

00:13:54.067 --> 00:13:57.237
Mom, Dad, I know this is weird, but...

00:13:57.321 --> 00:14:00.115
Yeah, yeah, we don't care how
squishy alien get pregnant.

00:14:00.198 --> 00:14:02.534
All we care is that
we have grandchild now.

00:14:02.617 --> 00:14:04.494
You're very open-minded, Mrs. Wong.

00:14:04.578 --> 00:14:06.121
Hey, you call her Grandma now.

00:14:06.204 --> 00:14:08.707
Call me Grandma like crazy. All the time.

00:14:09.541 --> 00:14:10.709
Check it out, y'all.

00:14:10.792 --> 00:14:12.252
Everyone we invited is here...

00:14:12.336 --> 00:14:13.712
Also Zoidberg!

00:14:13.795 --> 00:14:15.213
...so let's open the gifts!

00:14:17.257 --> 00:14:20.552
Can't wait.
We'll start with this one from Bender.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.142
It's my booties from when I was a kid.

00:14:27.225 --> 00:14:29.478
Uh, they're already bronzed.

00:14:29.561 --> 00:14:30.729
They are bronze.

00:14:30.812 --> 00:14:33.482
And this one's from Leela.

00:14:33.565 --> 00:14:35.567
Oh, I just love the bow.

00:14:35.651 --> 00:14:37.194
I wonder what it is.

00:14:37.277 --> 00:14:39.404
Yes, I wonder what we got you.

00:14:40.697 --> 00:14:43.325
It's a basket.

00:14:43.408 --> 00:14:44.534
For picnics?

00:14:44.618 --> 00:14:46.036
It means a lot to me.

00:14:46.119 --> 00:14:49.373
It's the basket my parents left me in
at the Orphanarium.

00:14:49.456 --> 00:14:51.208
You could use it for picnics.

00:14:51.291 --> 00:14:53.543
Here, Amy. We get this one for you.

00:14:53.627 --> 00:14:55.671
Oh, is it a new party-board?

00:14:57.030 --> 00:14:58.323
It's a board, all right.

00:14:58.407 --> 00:15:00.033
An ironing board.

00:15:00.117 --> 00:15:04.621
We had your old party-board converted
now that you not be partying anymore.

00:15:04.705 --> 00:15:07.332
You... You trashed my party-board?

00:15:07.416 --> 00:15:08.417
Damn right.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:13.005
Now you a mom, the only surfing you do
is under a big wave of responsibility.

00:15:13.088 --> 00:15:16.592
Oh, this is the happiest
moment of my life.

00:15:16.675 --> 00:15:20.721
You all brought such wonderful gifts,
but the greatest gift...

00:15:20.804 --> 00:15:21.805
Mine!

00:15:21.889 --> 00:15:24.933
...is the bond I share
with my Smizmar Amy,

00:15:25.017 --> 00:15:28.145
for soon, the quivering
mass of life within me

00:15:28.228 --> 00:15:30.147
will depend upon us both.

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:32.107
Even now, I can sense it

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:36.236
feeding, squirming, searching, questing,

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:39.823
and shortly,
it will rend my loins in twain,

00:15:39.907 --> 00:15:43.493
burst forth and pull us down, down, down

00:15:43.577 --> 00:15:46.204
into the deep, dark waters of commitment.

00:15:46.288 --> 00:15:50.000
That's so beautiful.

00:15:50.083 --> 00:15:52.586
Yes, it's... It's...

00:15:54.046 --> 00:15:56.340
No, I can't do this!

00:16:10.854 --> 00:16:12.981
Oh, how could Amy leave me?

00:16:13.065 --> 00:16:15.525
When will women learn
to take responsibility

00:16:15.609 --> 00:16:17.611
for the children they've helped create?

00:16:19.321 --> 00:16:21.823
The quickening! My time is near!

00:16:21.907 --> 00:16:25.452
I must return to my homeworld
to perform the ancient birthing rites.

00:16:25.869 --> 00:16:27.621
Let me know how that turns out.

00:16:48.725 --> 00:16:51.228
I must now embark on a perilous journey

00:16:51.311 --> 00:16:54.815
to give birth in precisely the same swamp
in which I was born.

00:16:54.898 --> 00:16:57.317
If it's so dangerous,
I'd better go with you.

00:16:57.401 --> 00:16:59.319
A gal has to protect her DNA.

00:16:59.403 --> 00:17:00.571
No, Leela.

00:17:00.654 --> 00:17:03.949
Tradition demands that
I make this journey with my Smizmar,

00:17:04.032 --> 00:17:07.828
and since Amy isn't here,
I must go it alone.

00:17:07.911 --> 00:17:11.248
Farewell, for we may never meet again.

00:17:17.004 --> 00:17:19.548
My scrapes feel a little better now.

00:17:22.885 --> 00:17:25.470
Hey, what's this fat, ugly thing?

00:17:25.554 --> 00:17:28.140
A frog, a toad, or yo' mama?

00:17:32.936 --> 00:17:34.438
It's a poisonous froad!

00:17:34.521 --> 00:17:35.814
No one move.

00:17:42.154 --> 00:17:44.823
I'm back, baby.

00:17:53.206 --> 00:17:54.458
Behold...

00:17:54.541 --> 00:17:58.420
The sacred ancestral
birthing grounds of my family.

00:17:58.503 --> 00:18:00.714
Smells like a jockstrap.

00:18:05.802 --> 00:18:08.388
I am the Grand Midwife!

00:18:08.472 --> 00:18:09.473
Hi.

00:18:09.556 --> 00:18:13.143
I am Kif of the clan Kroker,
come to bear my young.

00:18:13.227 --> 00:18:16.688
Then let the tea of new life be brewed.

00:18:16.772 --> 00:18:21.735
As it is writ,
"And both shall lift the jug together."

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:23.528
Where is your Smizmar?

00:18:23.612 --> 00:18:25.072
She is not with me.

00:18:25.155 --> 00:18:27.074
Oh, the sorrow!

00:18:27.157 --> 00:18:29.284
Oh, the shame!

00:18:29.743 --> 00:18:32.079
I'm sorry. I'm probably just
making you feel worse.

00:18:32.162 --> 00:18:34.623
As long as Amy is with me in my heart,

00:18:34.706 --> 00:18:36.708
I will have the strength of two.

00:18:41.838 --> 00:18:45.008
Apparently Amy hasn't been
working out much lately.

00:18:50.973 --> 00:18:53.016
As the tea boils,

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.978
please join hands
with your beloved Smizmar.

00:18:57.354 --> 00:18:58.355
Oh, right.

00:18:58.438 --> 00:19:00.983
Sorry, but I've memorized
the ceremony by rote

00:19:01.066 --> 00:19:02.234
and it mentions her a lot.

00:19:02.317 --> 00:19:03.443
I'll try to endure.

00:19:03.527 --> 00:19:04.903
Good, 'cause I'm not changing it.

00:19:04.987 --> 00:19:09.533
Now turn, ye two,
and gaze deeply into each other's eyes.

00:19:11.159 --> 00:19:12.494
What are you looking at?

00:19:12.786 --> 00:19:15.831
May the love I sense
between you at this moment

00:19:15.914 --> 00:19:19.126
remain with you both
through all your days.

00:19:22.879 --> 00:19:25.007
The tea of new life is ready.

00:19:25.382 --> 00:19:28.260
Let those whose love created this life

00:19:28.343 --> 00:19:31.013
speak each other's names, then drink.

00:19:35.934 --> 00:19:37.728
Amy.

00:19:37.811 --> 00:19:39.271
Kif!

00:19:42.983 --> 00:19:46.528
Amy, is it you
or have I gone crazy with loneliness?

00:19:46.862 --> 00:19:47.863
Both!

00:19:51.992 --> 00:19:53.910
I still don't know if I'm ready for this,

00:19:53.994 --> 00:19:55.871
but I do know I love you

00:19:55.954 --> 00:19:57.789
and I want to be here beside you.

00:19:57.873 --> 00:19:59.583
Great, now I lost my place.

00:19:59.666 --> 00:20:01.168
I'm starting over.

00:20:01.251 --> 00:20:02.752
Oh, no time.

00:20:02.836 --> 00:20:04.045
It is begun.

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:09.509
Oh, my...

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.098
Ew.

00:20:15.182 --> 00:20:16.600
Neat!

00:20:16.683 --> 00:20:18.310
You can do it, Kif.

00:20:20.103 --> 00:20:21.480
Ooh, nilly!

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.701
Oh, man!

00:20:40.749 --> 00:20:44.503
Amy, my love, tell me,
are they making it to the water?

00:20:50.233 --> 00:20:51.360
Amy!

00:20:51.443 --> 00:20:52.986
Shoo!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.821
Stay away from my babies!

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.376
The birthing is complete.

00:21:09.211 --> 00:21:10.253
Oh, thank goodness.

00:21:10.337 --> 00:21:12.506
I will now take my leave.

00:21:12.631 --> 00:21:15.842
I live here, so I won't actually
be going anywhere,

00:21:15.926 --> 00:21:18.303
but you don't have to talk to me anymore.

00:21:18.845 --> 00:21:20.180
- Congratulations!
- Nice work.

00:21:20.263 --> 00:21:21.390
Way to go, squishy!

00:21:24.017 --> 00:21:25.519
There goes my DNA.

00:21:25.686 --> 00:21:28.355
What a disgusting and beautiful process.

00:21:28.438 --> 00:21:29.940
That's birth for you.

00:21:30.023 --> 00:21:32.567
Well, we've given them a great start, Amy,

00:21:32.651 --> 00:21:37.698
and in 20 years, they'll sprout legs
and crawl back onto land as children.

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.200
I'll be ready then.